    "key_characteristics": "Primary treatment-naïve IDH-wildtype glioblastoma; unique mismatch repair-deficient subgroup comprised 2% (9/459) with somatic hypermutation and DNA replication repair deficiency due to biallelic inactivation of a canonical mismatch repair gene; deleterious mismatch repair gene mutations were often germline heterozygous with somatic inactivation of the remaining allele, consistent with Lynch syndrome; a subset had POLE proofreading domain mutations and ultrahypermutation; all tumors had giant cell variant histology."
  },
