      "timepoint": "median 68 minutes (IQR 48 to 88) post-injury",
      "effect": "Enhanced tissue, endothelial cell and glycocalyx damage and consumption coagulopathy with low protein C, antithrombin, fibrinogen and FXIII levels, hyperfibrinolysis and inflammation (P < 0.05)",
