  "summary": "In nationwide Dutch PROCESS 1 and PROCESS 2 studies, contamination of duodenoscopes and linear echoendoscopes was common, with MGO contamination around 15% for both device types, and was independent of device age, usage, and recorded reprocessing characteristics."
